policy/fiduciary.html" class="arrow-link-circ">お客さま本位の業務運営の取り組み</a><div class="grid grid--2cols grid--sp-2cols"> <a href="https://faq.kabu.com/s/?_gl=1*7gzcxg*_gcl_au*MjEwNDk1NDA5NC4xNzIyODQzMzU3#_ga=2.248982789.324213374.1729747072-943023878.1699239065"
